/-!
# The ellipse checker over all panels (generated by `tools/gen_quad_ellipse_facts.py`)

The 8 shard facts combine to `PanelGood` for all 1289 source panels with total error
`< 8 · 1040/8000000000000000 ≤ 1.06·10⁻¹²`, hence `QuadRemainderHyp`.

Agent-ID: claude-b9ee. Refs #303.
